# Fireglass Mentor: "At the beginning of your second main phase, if an opponent lost life this turn, exile the top two
# cards of your library. Choose one of them. Until end of turn, you may play that card." Bot1 bolts Bot2 in its first
# main phase, so the trigger happens: Mountain and Lightning Bolt are exiled, Bot1 chooses the Bolt and casts it from
# exile with Mox Ruby (Bot2 20 -> 17 -> 14). The Mountain, not chosen, cannot be played even though Bot1 has its land
# drop (the refusal beside the Bolt, which is the positive control).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Fireglass Mentor
Lightning Bolt
Island x2
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Fireglass Mentor.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
? Exile = Mountain; Lightning Bolt
! Bot1.Exile.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Exile.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 14
Exile = Mountain
Bot1.Library.Count = 12
Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Lightning Bolt; Black Lotus
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Fireglass Mentor
